</span> <span begin="33.063" end="33.672">flowers</span> <span begin="33.672" end="33.968">from</span> <span begin="33.968" end="34.319">a</span> <span begin="34.319" end="34.874">tomb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好似坟墓里绽放的花朵</span></p><p begin="34.874" end="38.859" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.874" end="35.507">While</span> <span begin="35.507" end="36.155">you</span> <span begin="36.155" end="37.132">decide</span> <span begin="37.132" end="37.420">who</span> <span begin="37.420" end="37.735">you</span> <span begin="37.735" end="38.859">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你定义自己的真实模样</span></p><p begin="39.091" end="41.255" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.091" end="39.386">And</span> <span begin="39.386" end="39.605">i</span> <span begin="39.605" end="39.874">can</span> <span begin="39.874" end="40.131">see</span> <span begin="40.131" end="40.518">right</span> <span begin="40.518" end="41.255">through</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可以一眼识破</span></p><p begin="42.720" end="44.984" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.720" end="43.039">Like</span> <span begin="43.039" end="43.672">shadows</span> <span begin="43.672" end="43.911">on</span> <span begin="43.911" end="44.294">the</span> <span begin="44.294" end="44.984">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好像月球上的阴影一样</span></p><p begin="44.984" end="48.103" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.984" end="45.216">And</span> <span begin="45.216" end="45.529">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="45.529" end="46.209">all</span> <span begin="46.506" end="47.448">bad</span> <span begin="47.448" end="48.103">news</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这一切都是坏消息</span></p><p begin="48.372" end="50.524" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.372" end="48.684">♡ yeah,</span> <span begin="48.684" end="49.333">i,</span> <span begin="49.333" end="49.908">i,</span> <span begin